      "text": {
        "zh_TW": "武師在村口等著你：「生日快樂，里歐！你爹託我讓你挑第一把兵器。先拿林邊那隻苔蛙練練手，我教你怎麼打，不合手就換。」",
        "en": "The weapon master is waiting at the village gate. \"Happy birthday, Leo! Your father asked me to let you pick your first weapon. Practise on the toad at the edge of the woods, and I will show you how to fight. Change if one does not suit you.\""
